  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "天使ê目屎——嘉明湖"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>鄭浩成</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFPbK3dD3t0zvbBhoQyBFQGLUSX4TKP4jRRF8T0Mx1WXb_tRHfjxojHyU-DTKV3-qo0NKnBjcEJ8V9R0FLQLedHS3eOcoXVtw5JsINmhfz5qLjGZcAYrHmxUUM3tlrnVRxrlow3R8LvhIM6kg9iYwK1uWmuXYjWbdcwShvdhtxAGWR2Fzvn5Mv9EoUS7Fl/s2048/398372583_10227113288590383_2244441580342321875_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFPbK3dD3t0zvbBhoQyBFQGLUSX4TKP4jRRF8T0Mx1WXb_tRHfjxojHyU-DTKV3-qo0NKnBjcEJ8V9R0FLQLedHS3eOcoXVtw5JsINmhfz5qLjGZcAYrHmxUUM3tlrnVRxrlow3R8LvhIM6kg9iYwK1uWmuXYjWbdcwShvdhtxAGWR2Fzvn5Mv9EoUS7Fl/w640-h480/398372583_10227113288590383_2244441580342321875_n.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī台灣ê中央山脈尾溜，有一个台灣海拔第二kuân ê湖，名叫「嘉明湖」。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2023年10月29，阮一家伙仔做陣去peh向陽山、三叉山kah嘉明湖，tse是阮第二擺挑戰tsit个路線，頂擺因為阮後生有「高山反應」，iáu未到山頂就放棄、落山--ah，tsit擺做好所有ê準備，就是想beh看見tsit个美麗ê kuân山湖。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjOJouBEtBiehH4iQVudITZ4kaoZ4aDPuED1FregapaN8ZvIthm9k-NkMXagC-EI_hrnDuk9EB-6NB-FhN4mD44-qeM7Aoa4L-JABB_r5YO8ohYzfRRRxUebTJ4DzFRwpWYDE1H3arTceqH4PN68dztog16hOLI6cF56nCHyg7zqet0gvwARigVpi1C2CTV/s1242/S__368353325_0.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"910\" data-original-width=\"1242\" height=\"468\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjOJouBEtBiehH4iQVudITZ4kaoZ4aDPuED1FregapaN8ZvIthm9k-NkMXagC-EI_hrnDuk9EB-6NB-FhN4mD44-qeM7Aoa4L-JABB_r5YO8ohYzfRRRxUebTJ4DzFRwpWYDE1H3arTceqH4PN68dztog16hOLI6cF56nCHyg7zqet0gvwARigVpi1C2CTV/w640-h468/S__368353325_0.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhbTasXZ6r9pVgBTWz0vpaN9O-Pap84ab67t0z7VGetGh4ZM1rmCMT339QWCke0Fr4AOLbU93Dcdk2JZ1N1jb7Ch7sIp8qeYBdctVO92jZpd00WWge15xbXPBTKLWRZuvuEgbHRR8golyN9tRcNBJq-n4bDheDOZmzclBh45hDzGtFlzM4KfEMOMjsYsSB2/s1479/S__368353327_0.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1479\" data-original-width=\"1109\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhbTasXZ6r9pVgBTWz0vpaN9O-Pap84ab67t0z7VGetGh4ZM1rmCMT339QWCke0Fr4AOLbU93Dcdk2JZ1N1jb7Ch7sIp8qeYBdctVO92jZpd00WWge15xbXPBTKLWRZuvuEgbHRR8golyN9tRcNBJq-n4bDheDOZmzclBh45hDzGtFlzM4KfEMOMjsYsSB2/w480-h640/S__368353327_0.jpg\" width=\"480\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjie-lbzLxTAO-noUS051o_T5FxcdKnoZQ4bAowbTffuusUpmGJMjTkkZ7rufhou5u_Cng1cLQvWOJj2XUkpmVHCBkEjHpE2ZYcP55cetYPYNuuvqPYZLI7_QVxs7gUxZRb_KyOWBZ4J6dUZ3sgK8kRUBC0-ShO70tljfYKc05UpMZP2Mgex1XXYCTd4eji/s1478/%E5%90%91%E9%99%BD%E5%B1%B1%E5%90%8D%E7%89%8C.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1478\" data-original-width=\"1108\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjie-lbzLxTAO-noUS051o_T5FxcdKnoZQ4bAowbTffuusUpmGJMjTkkZ7rufhou5u_Cng1cLQvWOJj2XUkpmVHCBkEjHpE2ZYcP55cetYPYNuuvqPYZLI7_QVxs7gUxZRb_KyOWBZ4J6dUZ3sgK8kRUBC0-ShO70tljfYKc05UpMZP2Mgex1XXYCTd4eji/w480-h640/%E5%90%91%E9%99%BD%E5%B1%B1%E5%90%8D%E7%89%8C.jpg\" width=\"480\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhRUNIUDZ7l1T7-lViEae26sKvuqZnjGWoV1Ghe7ON_YGal9fhyNLPwn2dsUVFXbj4FDJwujP9x_Jd3QNdBcmuoe5JgOcQwsRh1xQaE2S28aGf6nLetaQkWwndsZ0L6OTlWrr6RGFEuISFLk2hcSZpt7hrVFjKiMUCDk26dMCwX0PjrpKK5FD_xuhRVQ05X/s2048/%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%98%89%E6%98%8E%E6%B9%96.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2048\" data-original-width=\"1536\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhRUNIUDZ7l1T7-lViEae26sKvuqZnjGWoV1Ghe7ON_YGal9fhyNLPwn2dsUVFXbj4FDJwujP9x_Jd3QNdBcmuoe5JgOcQwsRh1xQaE2S28aGf6nLetaQkWwndsZ0L6OTlWrr6RGFEuISFLk2hcSZpt7hrVFjKiMUCDk26dMCwX0PjrpKK5FD_xuhRVQ05X/w480-h640/%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%98%89%E6%98%8E%E6%B9%96.jpg\" width=\"480\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhEZy8Zjp8QWtPCnC3iJ14jprrL_MSOG4pGoPD2XdQENu7ubL5uM4sG26eDk_h67UQKsjCdkZ3HCAfRsFIyYp_e-HJzhi4IjjKmQUMLNNib4g_4lCnlBLUk0D9y5g0fx0mCG5kYTRq70IbBgAnjeQ4rNqH3qw71o7YedeANuEqSoQGCfzOIO0-EJYZ4nS1B/s2169/%E9%BE%8D%E8%84%8A.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"640\" data-original-width=\"2169\" height=\"188\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhEZy8Zjp8QWtPCnC3iJ14jprrL_MSOG4pGoPD2XdQENu7ubL5uM4sG26eDk_h67UQKsjCdkZ3HCAfRsFIyYp_e-HJzhi4IjjKmQUMLNNib4g_4lCnlBLUk0D9y5g0fx0mCG5kYTRq70IbBgAnjeQ4rNqH3qw71o7YedeANuEqSoQGCfzOIO0-EJYZ4nS1B/w640-h188/%E9%BE%8D%E8%84%8A.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">1930年，日本人吉井隆成ê隊伍tī三叉山邊--a發現tsit个美麗ê湖，kā伊號一个名「シヌべシ池」（三叉池）。大約tī 1990年代初，聯勤測量隊</span><i><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">〔1〕</span></i><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tī南橫公路附近ê山區發現tsit个kuân山湖，兩名隊員kā in ê名各取一个字，tsiânn做「嘉明」湖，而且刊tī聯勤出版ê等高線地形圖頂面，就開始tī媒體流傳。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2003年，高師大齊士崢教授發表ê論文中，稱呼嘉明湖是「天使ê目屎」，了後就有tsiok濟形容tsit个湖ê名稱，比論講，「上帝留tī人間ê藍寶石」 、「卵池」。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">其實tī 100冬前，Bunun（『布農』）族uì南投盤山過嶺來到tsia，拍敗原本蹛tī tsia ê Tsou（『鄒』）族，勇士圍tī「cidanumas buan」報戰功，「cidanumas buan」tī Bunun族語ê意思是「月娘ê鏡」，最近Bunun族也發起將嘉明湖正名ê運動。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh去到嘉明湖，tsit-má有兩條路ē-sái行，一條是uì『戒茂斯山』山跤起行，盤過『戒茂斯山』往三叉山行，tsit條路線是Bunun族獵人傳統拍獵ê路線，khah歹行，ài ke行兩日，m̄-koh免抽山厝ê人額。另外一條就是傳統ê路線，uì向陽森林遊樂區行往向陽山kah三叉山，koh原路uat倒tńg--去，tsit擺阮有抽著山厝ê人額，koh殘殘三日lóng訂餐請協作員</span><i><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">〔2〕</span></i><span style=\"font-size: large;\">煮食，隨身行李重量liam-mi減四、五公斤--去，ke tsiok輕鬆。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拄開始ê三公里外，lóng是khah平ê崎，行--起-來真輕鬆，tī森林內底ê步道散步，天氣真秋凊，有時koh看著一寡仔罕見ê動物kah植物。Beh倚向陽山厝ê時，一隻烏雉雞tī阮面頭前出現，驚kā伊搭hiannh--著，阮liam跤bih手uì伊邊--a經過——平常時kan-na tī 1,000箍紙票頂面看ē著ê動物，親目睭看--見實在hōo人感動。M̄-koh，向陽山山區bat有台灣烏熊ê影跡，阮是希望m̄-thang拄--著khah好。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">第一工ê目標就是到向陽山ê山厝，因為安排三暝四日，時間khah liōng-siōng，逐工lóng ē-sái tī中晝進前到山厝。一方面koh因為秋天過中晝了後，山頂khah gâu罩bông霧，一方面khah早到山厝ē-tàng睏中晝。若無，暗時，逐家時間無啥拄好，有人早起、有人uànn睏，就歹睏落眠--ah。向陽山ê山厝tsiok sù-sī，有水koh有電，便所mā ē-tàng tshiâng水，第一工kah上尾工lóng是ē-tàng歇睏ê好所在。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">離開向陽山厝到山脊（suann-tsit）之間，是tī一大phiàn ê森林當中行踏，有時仔日頭ê光線thàng過樹葉仔，親像身軀mua一領溫暖ê番仔mua，ē-tàng感受著小可仔溫暖。了後，ē到一个烏水池，倚山邊ē-sái看著對面ê山脈，風景真suí。離開烏水池無偌久，就ē peh-tsiūnn山脊，tsit時沿路ê視野非常開闊，ē-sái看見南橫公路，khah遠ê玉山mā看kah真清楚。M̄-koh siunn過清楚，suah連suà--來beh行ê路是koh kuân koh崎mā看kah一清二楚，心內是淡薄仔ak-tsak，驚ē peh kah大khuì喘bē離。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮查某囝名叫「向晴」，所以阮lóng講向陽山是伊ê「本命山」。Tsit粒山頭是阮peh--過上kuân ê一粒，有3,600外公尺，當然景色講有偌suí就有偌suí。離開向陽山，就ē-tàng到嘉明湖ê山厝，tsit个山厝雖bóng khah簡單，m̄-koh tī 3,000公尺ê山頂，有一个ē-sái tsa̍h風遮雨ê所在，實在hōo人感覺安心。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh去嘉明湖ê hit日，阮半暝就起床出發，行tī烏暗ê山路，雖bóng有戴頭燈tshiō路，m̄-koh視線無夠清楚，阮就沓沓仔行，ná行ná看風景。一直到天跤拍phú仔光，日頭uì雲ê後面跳--出-來，規个天地因為日頭光--起-來，溫度mā變kah燒熱，阮tsiah跤步踏緊向前行，想beh khah緊看著嘉明湖。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">經過差不多六公里外，就看著三叉山ê門喙口。Tsit時iáu看bē著嘉明湖，需要uat過一个崎仔，tsiah ē看--見。早起ê嘉明湖有影suí，日頭光照tī湖面，hōo tsit个神祕ê湖koh-khah迷人，天色ê影跡，倒照tī湖面，kā天地ê景色連做伙，親像一幅tsiânn大幅ê圖。Khóng色ê天頂，有一點仔白色ê雲彩，青色ê山坪iáu有一tîng露水ê凝霜，三種色水，變化萬千——tsit幅迷人ê圖，hōo人m̄甘離開，就án-ne規下早仔留踮山頂，享受tsit个閒閒koh快活ê時tsūn。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人講tsiūnn山喘bē離，落山跤ē軟，m̄-koh落山總--是khah輕鬆，阮後生「澄風」ná親像一tsūn風，目一下nih就tsông去頭前--ah。可能因為伊頂擺高山反應無peh-tsiūnn山頂，tsit擺心情本底真緊張，到山頂了後，規个人ke khah輕鬆，hōo in老爸tī後壁jiok kah phēnn-phēnn喘，mā是看無伊ê車後燈。尾手規氣kah阮牽手兩个老歲仔ná開講ná行，享受森林內底ê芬多精。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">少年時愛衝，kan-na想beh khah緊到位，無去注意身邊ê事物；食老因為體力無夠，tsiah發見lio̍h仔停睏，欣賞身邊ê景緻mā有無仝ê感受。行tńg來到門喙口ê時，心內iáu-koh想講後一擺beh來去peh佗一粒山，tsit幾工ê艱苦kánn-ná完全放bē--記-得--ah。各位朋友，有閒ê時，約幾个伴，peh山拐仔紮--leh，揣一粒山頭做伙去感受lán台灣美麗島ê suí。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">1.聯勤測量隊是國軍唯一有專業測量技術ê部隊，平常時做測量ê khang-khuè，包括民間kah軍方ê業務。　</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">2.替山友tàu揹行李kah煮食ê職業，mā叫做『揹工、挑伕』。</p><!--more--><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgS6lL6nrFY46ld_K5oVQjaDcz7YNdh8CKu4nNGCqJYLmn3ly0Z0zGENWGy3ymk2hNppX9N5MkizLe7bVVPvDe4bX9HwPIkOtOl4r2HSSerxOYdSB4k9atdmaAcCb0KKitkPiSueax0acV4fEvrWQRjbo996-i32N08ifs_h0CczeBmn-NlvdDWhI0OI1Rt/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_14.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgS6lL6nrFY46ld_K5oVQjaDcz7YNdh8CKu4nNGCqJYLmn3ly0Z0zGENWGy3ymk2hNppX9N5MkizLe7bVVPvDe4bX9HwPIkOtOl4r2HSSerxOYdSB4k9atdmaAcCb0KKitkPiSueax0acV4fEvrWQRjbo996-i32N08ifs_h0CczeBmn-NlvdDWhI0OI1Rt/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_14.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjzF_lJegjKjOcObrDuOA7bUmiKjMop9w1MNcjTINHSuZ18bXNwjkHqUm5VyQuk7urf3BZGRF3YIPvqqSLAmQwP5pwbnX9ZJuSDYC7pOk7uZAREEdFiENfxHip2_xgdAPkRzewv0KW5wWHuzy1F24TJxIEfoPT1RAXZSln3lrrzOpnzRNqjwCVAYkBexL5K/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362